speechtext:
It is just a deletion. It has been pointed out that doubts have arisen as to the amounts, the additional amounts to be received. I would make it clear that the preamble as amended would read:
-for the resumption of the process of negotiation and mediation and for the final settlement of terms and conditions of employment for the years 1966 and 1967;
These are the two amendments that I propose to move. I could give hon. members the reasons why they are being made, but to expedite the business of the house and save time, I am now giving notice of my intention to so move.
